.page-content
  // Main content
  .content-wrapper
    // Simple panel
    .panel.panel-flat
      .panel-heading
        h5.panel-title Simple panel
        .heading-elements
          ul.icons-list
            li
              a(data-action='collapse')
            li
              a(data-action='close')
      .panel-body
        h6.text-semibold Start your development with no hassle!
        p.content-group
          | Common problem of templates is that all code is deeply integrated into the core. This limits your freedom in decreasing amount of code, i.e. it becomes pretty difficult to remove unnecessary code from the project. Limitless allows you to remove unnecessary and extra code easily just by removing the path to specific LESS file with component styling. All plugins and their options are also in separate files. Use only components you actually need!
        h6.text-semibold What is this?
        p.content-group
          | Starter kit is a set of pages, useful for developers to start development process from scratch. Each layout includes base components only: layout, page kits, color system which is still optional, bootstrap files and bootstrap overrides. No extra CSS/JS files and markup. CSS files are compiled without any plugins or components. Starter kit was moved to a separate folder for better accessibility.
        h6.text-semibold How does it work?
        p
          | You open one of the starter pages, add necessary plugins, uncomment paths to files in components.less file, compile new CSS. That's it. I'd also recommend to open one of main pages with functionality you need and copy all paths/JS code from there to your new page, it's just faster and easier.
    // /simple panel
    // Table
    .panel.panel-flat
      .panel-heading
        h5.panel-title Basic table
        .heading-elements
          ul.icons-list
            li
              a(data-action='collapse')
            li
              a(data-action='close')
      .panel-body
        | Starter pages include the most basic components that may help you start your development process - basic grid example, panel, table and form layouts with standard components. Nothing extra.
      .table-responsive
        table.table
          thead
            tr
              th #
              th First Name
              th Last Name
              th Username
          tbody
            tr
              td 1
              td Eugene
              td Kopyov
              td @Kopyov
            tr
              td 2
              td Victoria
              td Baker
              td @Vicky
            tr
              td 3
              td James
              td Alexander
              td @Alex
            tr
              td 4
              td Franklin
              td Morrison
              td @Frank
    // /table
    // Grid
    .row
      .col-md-6
        // Horizontal form
        .panel.panel-flat
          .panel-heading
            h5.panel-title Horizontal form
            .heading-elements
              ul.icons-list
                li
                  a(data-action='collapse')
                li
                  a(data-action='close')
          .panel-body
            form.form-horizontal(action='#')
              .form-group
                label.control-label.col-lg-2 Text input
                .col-lg-10
                  input.form-control(type='text')
              .form-group
                label.control-label.col-lg-2 Password
                .col-lg-10
                  input.form-control(type='password')
              .form-group
                label.control-label.col-lg-2 Select
                .col-lg-10
                  select.form-control(name='select')
                    option(value='opt1') Basic select
                    option(value='opt2') Option 2
                    option(value='opt3') Option 3
                    option(value='opt4') Option 4
                    option(value='opt5') Option 5
                    option(value='opt6') Option 6
                    option(value='opt7') Option 7
                    option(value='opt8') Option 8
              .form-group
                label.control-label.col-lg-2 Textarea
                .col-lg-10
                  textarea.form-control(rows='5', cols='5', placeholder='Default textarea')
              .text-right
                button.btn.btn-primary(type='submit')
                  | Submit form
                  i.icon-arrow-right14.position-right
        // /horizotal form
      .col-md-6
        // Vertical form
        .panel.panel-flat
          .panel-heading
            h5.panel-title Vertical form
            .heading-elements
              ul.icons-list
                li
                  a(data-action='collapse')
                li
                  a(data-action='close')
          .panel-body
            form(action='#')
              .form-group
                label Text input
                input.form-control(type='text')
              .form-group
                label Select
                select.form-control(name='select')
                  option(value='opt1') Basic select
                  option(value='opt2') Option 2
                  option(value='opt3') Option 3
                  option(value='opt4') Option 4
                  option(value='opt5') Option 5
                  option(value='opt6') Option 6
                  option(value='opt7') Option 7
                  option(value='opt8') Option 8
              .form-group
                label Textarea
                textarea.form-control(rows='4', cols='4', placeholder='Default textarea')
              .text-right
                button.btn.btn-primary(type='submit')
                  | Submit form
                  i.icon-arrow-right14.position-right
        // /vertical form
    // /grid
  // /main content
